OL,3,GNEWSAMum of drowned teen calls for
OL,4,Awater safety minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a boy who drowned at a
OL,7,Fbeach is calling on the government to
OL,8,Fappoint a water safety minister.
OL,10,FJoe Abbess, from Southampton, was 17
OL,11,Fwhen he died after getting dragged out
OL,12,Fto sea by a rip current on 31 May 2023.
OL,13,FSunnah Khan, 12, from High Wycombe,
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire, died in the same the
OL,15,Fincident.
OL,17,FJoe's mum Vanessa is delivering a
OL,18,Fletter to 10 Downing Street, alongside
OL,19,Fother bereaved families.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
